# Visual-capture artifacts are EPHEMERAL — never tracked. The harness writes
# capture PNGs + composites + manifests/logs into a caller-chosen output dir
# (demo/, tb/, sxs/, MANIFEST*, *.log); defaults land in /tmp, but if a run
# points its BASE inside this folder these patterns keep them out of git.
#
# Allowlist: only the tracked harness scripts + docs live here. Add a new
# `!path` line to track any future script.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!probe-tb.mjs
!tb-shoot.mjs
!stitch-sxs.mjs
